1. Project purpose
A college has one physical event kit with three items:
- KIT-001: the event kit
- ITEM-CAM-01: camera
- ITEM-TRI-01: tripod
- ITEM-MIC-01: microphone
Multiple college clubs can reserve this kit for different time slots. The application must prevent booking conflicts, enforce a 15-minute inspection gap, manage checkout and return inspections, track missing or damaged equipment, notify affected clubs, and maintain audit history.
